    {
      "source": "Note that this adapter resolves expressions as well, in contrast\nto the <a href=\"ConfigurableBeanFactory.html#resolveEmbeddedValue(java.lang.String)\"><code>ConfigurableBeanFactory.resolveEmbeddedValue(String)</code></a> method.\nThe <a href=\"BeanExpressionContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanExpressionContext</code></a> used is for the plain bean factory,\nwith no scope specified for any contextual objects to access.",
      "translation": "请注意，此适配器也会解析表达式，这与 <a href=\"ConfigurableBeanFactory.html#resolveEmbeddedValue(java.lang.String)\"><code>ConfigurableBeanFactory.resolveEmbeddedValue(String)</code></a> 方法不同。所使用的 <a href=\"BeanExpressionContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanExpressionContext</code></a> 是针对普通 Bean 工厂的，未为任何上下文对象指定作用域以供访问。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"../../../util/StringValueResolver.html#resolveStringValue(java.lang.String)\">StringValueResolver</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"../../../util/StringValueResolver.html#resolveStringValue(java.lang.String)\">StringValueResolver</a></code></span>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Resolve the given String value, for example parsing placeholders.",
      "translation": "解析给定的 String 值，例如解析占位符。",
