      "translation": "`<a href=\"../../../util/StringValueResolver.html#resolveStringValue(java.lang.String)\">resolveStringValue</a>` 在接口 `<a href=\"../../../util/StringValueResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.util\">StringValueResolver</a>` 中",
